<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mt-12 mb-20">
  <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-12">
    <div class="text-center mb-8">
      <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Our Promise</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Eligibility first</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">If the eligibility check shows your route does not work, the process simply stops there. No further costs arise.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Start small</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">You begin with the first step, not the full package.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">No hidden costs</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">State fees and third-party costs are always listed upfront.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
